[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1421","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1421.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1240","title":"cddbd CD 数据库服务器缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"cddbd CD 数据库服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向该服务发送特制的超长日志消息触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 cddbd 服务器软件，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户升级至最新版本或限制对 cddbd 服务的网络访问以降低风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1240"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-11-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:01Z","remediation":"立即升级 cddbd 至 1.4.5 及以上版本。如无法升级，建议在防火墙层面限制 cddbd 服务端口（默认 888/TCP）的访问来源为受信任 IP，并对输入日志长度进行校验作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/5784","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2203","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1240.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1240","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1240.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1240.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-35g9-mghc-h66h/GHSA-35g9-mghc-h66h.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87808/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1240.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000111.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/28a6d08daac937b384e80635b6d3e669d1c826ac/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1421.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1332","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1332.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1099","title":"KTH Kerberos 4 信息泄露漏洞","description":"KTH Kerberos 4 实现存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 Kerberos 服务发送特制的畸形 UDP 数据包触发错误响应，该错误字符串会无意中包含 Kerberos 领域名称（realm name）及最近登录用户信息，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞收集目标环境信息，为进一步攻击提供铺垫。该漏洞影响 KTH Kerberos 4 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1099"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-11-22T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:43Z","remediation":"立即将 Kerberos 4 升级至 MIT Kerberos 5 或 Heimdal，Kerberos 5 在 Kerberos 4 兼容模式下同样不受此漏洞影响。如无法升级 Kerberos 版本，可参考 OpenBSD 的补丁对 KDC 的 UDP 请求输入验证进行修复，同时在防火墙层面限制 UDP 端口 750 仅允许受信任网段访问，以阻止外部攻击者利用畸形 UDP 包窃取 realm 名称和用户名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420184&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/65"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1332.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1412","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1412.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1221","title":"Digital Unix OSF/1 dxchpwd 符号链接攻击文件任意修改漏洞","description":"Digital Unix（即 OSF/1）3.x 版本中的 dxchpwd 程序存在符号链接攻击漏洞。该程序在运行过程中会以不安全的方式处理名为 dxchpwd.log 的日志文件，本地已登录的普通用户可通过预先创建指向任意系统文件的符号链接来替换该日志文件路径。当 dxchpwd 以较高权限写入日志时，实际写入的是被链接指向的任意文件，从而导致本地用户未经授权地修改系统上的任意文件内容。该漏洞影响范围限于运行 Digital Unix 3.x 且本地存在普通用户账户的系统，攻击条件为攻击者需具备本地登录权限并能在程序运行前布置恶意符号链接，利用方式是通过符号链接劫持实现本地文件任意篡改，可能造成系统配置文件或关键数据被恶意修改，CVSS 基础评分约为 2.1，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1221"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-11-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:58Z","remediation":"升级到已修复该符号链接问题的 Digital Unix（OSF/1）后续补丁版本（建议应用厂商 ECO/DUX 补丁至 4.0 及以上）。在无法立即升级时，可移除 dxchpwd 程序的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/dxchpwd）或限制普通用户对 dxchpwd.log 所在目录的写权限，以阻止符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420141&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/399","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1221.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1221","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1221.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d0833866f347223eab80ef68cc3e2461a4e724d/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1221.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ce77465efdf58fc31a7a0bc8c83705be48abcedf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h3fg-8cfw-765c/GHSA-h3fg-8cfw-765c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87551/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1221.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000109.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1216817b1ffea775aa09a87ad4eb5d4ec3f12b57/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1412.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0279","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0279.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0130","title":"Sendmail 守护进程本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Sendmail 在处理守护进程模式启动时存在本地权限提升漏洞。由于 Sendmail 二进制文件设置了 setuid root 权限，本地攻击者可以通过启动 Sendmail 守护进程模式，利用其与 setuid 相关的缺陷获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 BSD 2、Sendmail 8.x、FreeBSD 2.1.x、HP-UX 10.x、AIX 4、RedHat 4 等多个 Unix 系操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0130"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-11-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:39Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.9.0 或更高版本，该版本重构了 daemon 模式权限检查，禁止普通用户以 root 权限启动 daemon。各受影响操作系统（BSD/FreeBSD/HP-UX/AIX/RedHat）厂商均已发布对应安全补丁，可联系厂商获取。临时缓解措施：移除 sendmail 二进制文件的 setuid root 位（`chmod u-s /usr/sbin/sendmail`），但会影响正常邮件投递功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/716","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19556","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0130.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab669d9fb37e52ed0619cb2b8265d34528fbe875/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0130.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0130","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0130.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0130.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0130.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2d2ea2d13a3a7facfa195486d4f9782c62a06518/1999/CVE-1999-0130.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0130.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0130.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b69cf2313f68e29acceed58f52f6109cd37bb04/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-01xx/CVE-1999-0130.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0279.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1371","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1371.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1161","title":"HP HP-UX ppl 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.x及更早版本中的ppl程序存在安全漏洞，本地用户可通过强制ppl程序产生core dump文件的方式获取root权限。该漏洞源于ppl程序对core dump文件的处理缺陷，攻击者无需认证即可利用，完全影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1161"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-11-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即应用HP安全公告HPSBUX9704-057中提供的补丁程序，或升级至已修复此漏洞的HP-UX版本。如无法升级，可移除ppl程序的setuid权限位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/ppl），以消除本地用户通过强制core dump获取root权限的攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/h-32.shtml","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420102&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420103&w=2","http://www.codetalker.com/advisories/vendor/hp/hpsbux9704-057.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7438.php"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1371.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0554","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0554.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0336","title":"HP HP-UX mstm 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统中的 mstm 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 mstm 程序发送特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的关键数据结构，成功利用后可获取系统的 root 最高权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可从本地利用，完全控制受影响系统，影响 HP-UX 多个版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0336"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-11-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:10Z","remediation":"立即从 HP Support Portal 获取并安装对应 HP-UX 版本的 mstm 安全补丁（搜索 HP-UX Security Bulletin 相关条目）。如无法打补丁，可执行 `chmod 500 /usr/bin/mstm` 移除 setuid root 权限，阻止普通用户通过该二进制提权；同时通过文件权限将 mstm 执行权限限制为仅 root 用户，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0336"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0554.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0518","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0518.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0311","title":"HP-UX fpkg2swpk 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统中的 fpkg2swpk 工具存在权限提升漏洞，本地普通用户可利用该工具未正确处理权限的缺陷，通过执行特定操作获取 root 权限。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，成功利用后可完全控制受影响的 HP-UX 系统，执行任意操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0311"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1996-11-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 至 11.0 及以上版本，或安装 HP 安全公告 HPSBUX9612-042 中对应的补丁。如无法升级，可移除 fpkg2swpk 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/fpkg2swpk）并限制可执行用户组，阻断本地提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0311","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9612-042"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0518.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1260","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1260.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1384","title":"SGI IRIX Systour/OutOfBox 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 5.x 至 6.3 版本的 systour（Indigo Magic System Tour）功能包中存在本地权限提升漏洞。当 RemoveSystemTour 程序执行 inst 命令时，会调用 .exitops 程序；本地攻击者可通过植入特洛伊木马化的 .exitops 程序，诱使该流程以 root 权限执行恶意代码，从而获取系统最高权限。该漏洞影响 IRIX 5.x 至 6.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，且已有公开的利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1384"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-10-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:19Z","remediation":"已停产的 SGI IRIX 不再接收安全更新，建议立即卸载 systour 软件包（`versions remove systour`），或将包含的 RemoveSystemTour 脚本中 .exitops 的调用删除并设置正确的文件权限（`chmod 000`），同时将系统升级至 IRIX 6.5 以上版本以消除该漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420095&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7456.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/470","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19356","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1384.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1384","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1384.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1384.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-5g4r-8w5q-c4xj/GHSA-5g4r-8w5q-c4xj.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000107.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5bcf7eb0-19c4-4291-a9b6-314376ea598b.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1384.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1260.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0463","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0463.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0277","title":"Sun Solaris WorkMan 任意文件覆盖本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中的 WorkMan 日历程序存在任意文件覆盖漏洞。本地攻击者可利用 WorkMan 程序的缺陷，通过符号链接攻击或直接指定路径覆盖系统任意文件（如 /etc/passwd 或 /bin/su 等），从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 系统，攻击者需要拥有本地用户账号才能利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。通过覆盖关键系统文件实现提权，目前厂商已发布相关安全公告。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0277"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:03Z","remediation":"立即移除 WorkMan 二进制文件的 setuid 权限：执行 `chmod -s /usr/bin/workman`。如已安装 Sun 补丁 100176-01（适用于 Solaris 2.4/2.5/2.5.1），请安装该补丁修复符号链接竞争条件。若业务不需要该日历程序，建议直接删除 `/usr/bin/workman` 以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0277"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0463.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0094","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0032","title":"BSD系统 lpr 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"BSD 系统的 lpr 打印服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向带 -C（分类）选项的 lpr 命令传入超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 BSD/OS 2.1、FreeBSD 2.1.5、NeXTstep 4.x、IRIX 6.4、SunOS 4.1.3/4.1.4 等基于 BSD 的系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0032"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-10-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:23Z","remediation":"建议将系统升级至已修复该漏洞的版本（FreeBSD 2.2 及以上、BSD/OS 3.0 及以上、IRIX 6.5 及以上），或应用厂商补丁替换存在缓冲区溢出的 lpr 二进制。如无法升级，可通过移除 lpr 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/lpr）限制本地普通用户提权，或改用 cups-lpr 等现代打印系统替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/i-042.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/707"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0187","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0187.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0075","title":"Washington University wu-ftpd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"wu-ftpd 守护进程在处理 PASV 命令时存在缺陷，已通过身份认证的攻击者向 FTP 服务器发送特制的 QUOTE PASV 命令后，可触发 ftpd 进程产生核心转储（core dump），造成敏感内存信息泄露或导致服务拒绝。该漏洞影响早期版本的 wu-ftpd 服务，攻击者需先获取有效的登录凭据才能利用此漏洞，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0075"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-10-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:31Z","remediation":"升级 wu-ftpd 至 2.5 或更高版本以修复 PASV 命令处理缺陷；如无法升级，在 /etc/ftpaccess 中设置 passive off 禁用 PASV 模式作为临时缓解。由于 wu-ftpd 已停止维护，建议长期迁移至 vsftpd 或 ProFTPD 等仍在维护的 FTP 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/5742"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0187.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0419","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0419.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0234","title":"GNU Bash 命令分隔符注入漏洞","description":"Bash 在处理命令解析时存在分隔符逻辑缺陷，会将字节值 255（0xFF）错误识别为命令分隔符。攻击者通过向 Bash 执行的字符串中注入包含 0xFF 字节的特制数据，可导致命令注入，实现以当前用户权限执行任意命令，造成机密性、完整性、可用性部分损失。该漏洞影响 openlinux 等使用早期 Bash（1.x 及以前版本）的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0234"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-10-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:58Z","remediation":"立即升级 Bash 至 2.0 或更高版本，255 字节在已修复版本中不会被解析为命令分隔符。如无法升级，可对用户输入进行严格过滤，移除或替换 ASCII 255 字节（0xFF），并限制不可信数据传入交互式 Bash 环境。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0234"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0419.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0531","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0531.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0319","title":"xmcd 2.1 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"xmcd 2.1 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过精心构造的用户资源设置触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而获取额外系统访问权限。该漏洞影响 xmcd 2.1 版本，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用，属于本地权限提升漏洞，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0319"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:08Z","remediation":"升级 xmcd 至 2.2 及以上版本（最新版本为 3.3.2），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复对用户资源设置的边界检查。如无法升级，可移除 xmcd 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/X11/xmcd）以防止本地提权，或删除 xmcd 的 setuid 位并限制仅受信任用户可执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0319"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0531.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0515","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0515.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0308","title":"HP-UX gwind 任意文件修改漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统中的 gwind 程序存在任意文件修改漏洞，由于程序权限设置不当或缺乏充分的访问控制检查，本地攻击者可通过向 gwind 程序传递特制参数修改系统中的任意文件，造成系统文件被篡改或权限提升。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 操作系统，攻击者需拥有本地系统账号方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0308"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:07Z","remediation":"立即移除 `gwind` 程序的 setuid 权限位：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/X11/gwind`，防止普通用户以特权身份运行该程序修改任意系统文件。如 HP-UX 版本仍在厂商支持范围内，请安装对应安全补丁（参考 HP 安全公告 HPSBUX9410-018）。如无法打补丁，建议限制可执行 `gwind` 的用户组或直接删除该程序以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9410-018"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0515.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0431","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0431.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0246","title":"HP Remote Watch 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"HP Remote Watch 是 HP-UX 系统上的一款远程监控服务，存在未授权访问漏洞。未经认证的远程攻击者无需任何身份验证即可通过网络直接利用该服务，获取目标系统的完全 root 权限，导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全沦陷。该漏洞 CVSS v2.0 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击复杂度低，影响范围广泛。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0246"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:59Z","remediation":"立即停止 Remote Watch 服务：执行 `rwatch -k` 终止运行中的守护进程，并从 `/etc/inittab` 或 `/etc/rc.config.d/remotewatch` 中移除自动启动配置。如果业务不需要远程监控功能，彻底卸载 Remote Watch 子系统（`swremove RemoteWatch`）。必须通过防火墙限制 TCP 端口 1770 的入站访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0246","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab6ab436962e16237b21ed9d4458dafc38c692fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0246.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0246","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0246.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0246.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0246.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-848h-2v7f-436w/GHSA-848h-2v7f-436w.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/remwatch.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82085/info.html","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/97009c469920f4d8991128f84d19644c3badca15/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-02xx/CVE-1999-0246.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0431.toml"}]